msgstr "สเปราล"

msgid "Top surface density"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Density of top surface infill, 100% means a fully solid filled top layer.Lower values create a textured top"
" surface, at 0%, only the walls are created on the top layer.Intended for aesthetic or functional purposes,"
" not to fix issues such as over-extrusion."
msgstr ""

msgid "Monotonic line travel extend"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Enable this option to extend the travel distance between lines, improving the adhesion between the "
"monotonic line infill and the walls.(percent to line width)"
msgstr ""

